    Title: On/Off Duty
    Description: The system's ready to go, but someone's gotta go to the [LOCATION] and turn on the switches. Any takers?
  - Descriptor: GI_SQN_1
    Title: Supplies or Die
    Description: It's time for the regular supply run, and it's the [LOCATION]'s turn to offer up the goods. Try not to get killed.
