    Title: Profound Crap
    Description: As Shooter used to say, "Supplies are the difference between us and the dead". Huh. Nothing like telling it like it is.
  - Descriptor: GI_SQN_25
    Title: Lost in the Wash
    Description: Today's [LOCATION] shopping list; ammo, sparkplugs, tinned fruit, gum and socks. Never can have enough socks…
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_1
    Title: Survivor Savior
    Description: 'How DO they manage to survive? The wrong place at the wrong time - and you''re their only hope. '
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_2
    Title: Monitor Life
    Description: The tracking monitor's going haywire - lots of movement in the [LOCATION]. Survivors - or zombies?
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_3
    Title: Sanity Patrol
    Description: You'll go mad if you don’t get some company. Possible survivor alert near the [LOCATION]. Madness can wait.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_4
    Title: Dead or Down
    Description: Survivor sighting near the [LOCATION] - but the movement tracker's stopped. Dead - or down? Go check.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_5
    Title: Live and Let Die
    Description: The [LOCATION] is dangerous - and you want to live - but you can't let them die. And they WON'T die on YOUR watch.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_6
    Title: Zombie Exodus
    Description: Biters on the move near the [LOCATION]. Check for survivors - and tag a few meatbags.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_7
    Title: A Cry For Help
    Description: Zombies don’t cry - so that must be a survivor you hear on the monitor. Destination [LOCATION], the mission is ON!
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_8
    Title: Epic Fail
    Description: Somebody slipped up. Found themselves in a level they couldn't clear. Time for end-game [LOCATION].
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_9
    Title: I Am A Human Being!
    Description: What's one more human worth in a world of zombies?One more survivor, saved - but for how long?
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_10
    Title: Dinner Time
    Description: Crazy survivor ran off to the [LOCATION]. Thought you were going to eat him. You're not THAT hungry - yet.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_11
    Title: 'Brave Olympian '
    Description: You managed to save SO many people yesterday - but now you're going for the record. Start with the [LOCATION].
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_12
    Title: Here and Now
    Description: '[LOCATION]. Now. Got live ones on the monitor. With any luck, they''ll become survivors today…'
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_13
    Title: Survivor Lottery
    Description: You hope you can save someone useful today - a Doctor, perhaps, or a mechanical engineer. Enough to build a brand new world?
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_14
    Title: Equation of Despair
    Description: So few survivors - so little time. Is this the start of a brave new civilization - or a waste of that time?
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_15
    Title: On the Run
    Description: They made a run for it - you told them not to. [LOCATION]. Damn - now you're gonna have to save them again.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_16
    Title: Flash Mob
    Description: No way the zombies are leaving the [LOCATION] - and you saw PEOPLE there. Hoping for salvation - or a quick death.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_17
    Title: Lucky Strike
    Description: You're going straight to the [LOCATION]. Someone might be left alive in there - you never know, pigs might fly.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_18
    Title: 'Frantic S.O.S. '
    Description: Emergency traffic on the long wave - somebody's stuck in the [LOCATION]! Time to make a quick job of being a hero.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_19
    Title: Facts of Life
    Description: Civilians. Workers. Doctors and nurses. Each and every survivor has value. You're starting again - the human race.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_20
    Title: Sloppy Seconds
    Description: You keep telling them not to go to the [LOCATION]! Do they listen? No! Go pick up any idiots that are leftovers.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_21
    Title: Primordial Soup
    Description: Better save that survivor stuck in the [LOCATION], or it'll be another dip in the gene pool and a fresh new zombie.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_22
    Title: Dear Shooter
    Description: Dear Shooter, survivors trapped in the [LOCATION] again today. You probably would have left them. Love Evelyn.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_23
    Title: Is It Safe?
    Description: Some ex-dentists formed a paramilitary breakaway group. Now they're stuck in the [LOCATION] and need an extraction.
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_24
    Title: Space Invaders
    Description: 'Curly-haired kid, name of Enzo, wants you to save his buddy. Got lost looking for video games near the [LOCATION]. '
  - Descriptor: MS_SQN_25
    Title: Tour De Rescue
    Description: First thing you heard about a survivor called "Golden" Wiggins was when you were sent in for a rescue, [LOCATION].
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_1
    Title: Don't Get Dead
    Description: 'Today? You''re not going to die. You''re going to live. It''s the meatbags down at the [LOCATION] who are gonna die. '
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_2
    Title: Analyse Your Scans
    Description: Scanning the [LOCATION]… Multiple meatheads detected. Kill them all.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_3
    Title: Be Afraid
    Description: There's too many of them. Don’t go today. You can go to the [LOCATION] tomorrow. But not today.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_4
    Title: Stay Hungry
    Description: You don’t clear out the [LOCATION] now, you're not going to eat. And eventually, you'll die. So go do it!
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_5
    Title: Clean It Up
    Description: The [LOCATION] is swarming with biters, making a mess of the whole goddamn place. Clear them out.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_6
    Title: Blood Cover
    Description: Sure, you'll be standing knee-deep in blood and body parts. But it'll be worth it. You'll own the [LOCATION] again.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_7
    Title: Circle of Life
    Description: It's simple. You clear out the [LOCATION], they come back. You do it again. But they just keep coming. Do it again.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_8
    Title: Zombie Rush
    Description: You thought zombies were supposed to be SLOW. The ones in the [LOCATION] aren't. Life sucks, sometimes.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_9
    Title: Moving Day
    Description: Just when you get one sucker lined up in your sights, another comes along. This is why man made explosive weapons.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_10
    Title: Boom-Bang-A-Bang
    Description: It's the rhythm of death. A song of blood and guts. The [LOCATION] is ready to hear your sweet, savage music.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_11
    Title: My Favorite Things
    Description: Zombies are filthy creatures, dripping pus and blood. They carry diseases - and they bite. So keep destroying them.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_12
    Title: Vital Signs
    Description: Take back the [LOCATION]. Don’t let the creepers creep, the biters bite, and the crawlers snuff out your life.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_13
    Title: One Life Only
    Description: It's not a fair fight - it's dangerous and disgusting… But it's the only life you've got, and you're going to keep it.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_14
    Title: Not Left to Fate
    Description: The [LOCATION] is infested. You're going to have to kill some zombies. And then kill some more. Get it done.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_15
    Title: A New Dawn
    Description: The shadow of death lies heavy over the [LOCATION]. Go there and let a little light in. Kill them all.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_16
    Title: Noisy Neighbors
    Description: 'Zombies around the [LOCATION] are too close for comfort. Time to clear out another zone, meathead by meathead.  '
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_17
    Title: Laser-Like Precision
    Description: You need to cut a path through the zombie-infested [LOCATION] - supplies can't get through. You're good at cutting…
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_18
    Title: Too Tight to Train
    Description: Go on. Work up a sweat. Berserker frenzy. The [LOCATION]'s full of biters and you need to let off some steam.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_19
    Title: 'Volunteer Needed '
    Description: You need to set an example, show how it's done. You raise your hand and [LOCATION]'s zombies are history.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_20
    Title: Tickets, Please
    Description: Big party night down by the [LOCATION]. Want to get armpit-deep in zombies? Now's your chance!
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_21
    Title: On Point
    Description: The advance party must have bought it - biters running wild around the [LOCATION]. Now YOU'RE the advance party.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_22
    Title: Social Meatwork
    Description: So. You go down to the [LOCATION], you meet many strange and interesting new breeds of zombies. Then you kill them.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_23
    Title: Dear Shooter
    Description: Dear Shooter, you know what I miss most? Beach Volleyball. That - and not having to kill biters every day. Love Evelyn x
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_24
    Title: Meeting Meat
    Description: The [LOCATION]'s infested with zombies. For all the difference it makes, wipe them out. They'll just keep coming.
  - Descriptor: KA_SQN_25
    Title: Get Off My Cloud
    Description: 'Some days you feel like you''re wired to explode, born to kill. Today is one of those days. Try the [LOCATION]. '
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_1
    Title: Anybody Out There?
    Description: You'll want some help securing the [LOCATION] - you need to set up an airwave scan, and that takes time.
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_2
    Title: Military Speak
    Description: Escort duty - you're up. Clear the [LOCATION] and set up the checkpoint sensor locations. Whatever THOSE are…
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_3
    Title: Counter Attack
    Description: 'Zombie incursion - the [LOCATION]''s gone red. Don’t go down there unless you''re packing back-up. '
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_4
    Title: Zombie 101
    Description: Your research project for today is "Biters" - Biters in the [LOCATION]. Take an escort and find out what you can.
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_5
    Title: Tour of Duty
    Description: It's tourist time for the [LOCATION] today, new survivor orientation. With a little armed escort on the side.
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_6
    Title: Rigor Mortis
    Description: New escort today - just keep it calm, take it slow. Don't freeze in the headlights or you'll be bambi. And dead.
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_7
    Title: Dear Shooter
    Description: Dear Shooter, when ya coming to get me? Sure, I got back-up, but if I hear "yes, ma'am" one more time I'll SCREAM. Love E.
  - Descriptor: ES_SQN_8
    Title: On/Off Duty
    Description: The system's ready to go, but someone's gotta go to the [LOCATION] and turn on the switches. Any takers?
  - Descriptor: THEPIT
    Title: The Pit Fighter
    Description: That psycho has trapped you inside the sump. Do not let zombies of toxic waste get you!
  - Descriptor: FPS_TEST
    Title: FPS_TEST
    Description: 3 WAVES ONLY WITH SPECIALS AND SURVIVALS TO TEST DIFFERENT
  - Descriptor: IND0
    Title: IND0
    Description: indoor test
  - Descriptor: IND1
    Title: IND1
    Description: indoor test
