  LoadingScreenDescriptors:
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Evelyn
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: COME EQUIPPED
    WhiteText: It is important to have multiple weapons when playing a mission, ammo can be very scarce.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Evelyn
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: AMMO CRATES
    WhiteText: Search the rooms for Ammo Crates which will fill up ammo on all of your weapons.
    RedHeader: BONUS CRATES
    RedText: Provide additional bonuses and valuable items but are well hidden.
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 2
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 5
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Evelyn
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: CAMERA MOVEMENT
    WhiteText: To aim and move the camera hold the right side of the screen.
    RedHeader: SHOOTING
    RedText: Shooting is done automatically when zombie is in the cross-hairs.
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 4
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Evelyn
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: SCOPED WEAPONS
    WhiteText: Weapons with a scope allow you to go into zoom mode.
    RedHeader: ZOOM MODE
    RedText: Once in Zoom Mode tap the icon on the lower right to fire.
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 7
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Wallis
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: CONSUMABLE
    WhiteText: Swipe across the icon to choose grenades, a medkit or a power up. Tap the icon to use it.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 8
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Thrower
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 4
    WhiteHeader: THROWER
    WhiteText: His body serves as a host to parasitic egg-like larvae that explode on contact when thrown from a distance.
    RedHeader: TACTICAL HINT
    RedText: Move fast when Thrower begins to launch his projectiles. Be sure to attack him when he is trying to fall back and reload.
    IsSpecial: 1
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 9
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Bomber
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    WhiteHeader: BOMBER
    WhiteText: A scientist in a hazmat suit who died on the job and is now roaming SHS. The suit is inflated with poison gas that can blow up any time!
    RedHeader: TACTICAL HINT
    RedText: Do not let Bomber come close. Shoot him from a distance. Otherwise he will explode and deal a lot of damage!
    IsSpecial: 1
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 10
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Piper
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 6
    WhiteHeader: PIPER
    WhiteText: This creature is a result of sick genetic SHS experiments. Twisted and cowardly it still provides a great threat.
    RedHeader: TACTICAL HINT
    RedText: Kill Piper as soon as possible or he will call siblings to his aid. Piper will fight back aggressively when cornered.
    IsSpecial: 1
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 11
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Charger
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 7
    WhiteHeader: SMASHER
    WhiteText: Mutation has increased the growth of his muscles but severely damaged the brain.
    RedHeader: TACTICAL HINT
    RedText: Dodge Smasher's charge and shoot him when he is stunned.
    IsSpecial: 1
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 12
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Spitter
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 9
    WhiteHeader: SPITTER
    WhiteText: Savehaven prisoners were genetically altered and the prison was flooded with toxic waste. Some of them have survived.
    RedHeader: TACTICAL HINT
    RedText: Try to keep your distance from Spitter. He is vulnerable while spewing his toxic sludge.
    IsSpecial: 1
  - Type: 1
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 30
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Wallis
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: CONSUMABLE
    WhiteText: Swipe across the icon to choose grenades, a medkit or a power up. Tap the icon to use it.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 2
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 8
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Shsecurity
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 3
    WhiteHeader: SH SECURITY
    WhiteText: Former security officers are tough and hard to kill.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 2
    IsMissionPredefined: 1
    PredefinedMission: 9
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Shhazamat
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 1
    UnlockLevel: 4
    WhiteHeader: SCIENTISTS
    WhiteText: Zombie scientists can not be stunned and will advance until they are killed.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Evelyn
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: HEADSHOTS
    WhiteText: Headshots do more damage but are more difficult.
    RedHeader: SPECIAL ZOMBIES
    RedText: All special zombies are immune to headshots.
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Wallis
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: AMMO
    WhiteText: Always pay attention to your ammo and how much ammo you have left in the current clip.
    RedHeader: RELOADING
    RedText: Reload  during breaks in the action by tapping on the weapon icon in the upper right hand corner.
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Wallis
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: OUT OF AMMO
    WhiteText: If you run out of ammo, switch to your melee weapon.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
    IsMissionPredefined: 0
    PredefinedMission: 0
    PicturePath: LoadingScreens/Wallis
    ShowAtLevelUpPopup: 0
    UnlockLevel: 0
    WhiteHeader: KEEP MOVING
    WhiteText: You can avoid zombies while reloading by keeping on the move.
    RedHeader:
    RedText:
    IsSpecial: 0
  - Type: 0
